        f'Look words up in Russian, not English: {ME} read wiktionary-ru',
        f'Literature: Turgenev, Goncharov, Dostoevsky, Griboedov, Eugene Onegin ({ME} listen --level B2)',
        f'Words: {ME} words --level B2 (+7,700 words)',
